From 127719dae0449532ee115755eeb5d25c714c2fae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 09:49:55 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] www: kit pages for WPS, WDS, MAC Filter, RADIUS, Roaming
 Block, MLO and VLAN; stock tabs unshipped

Reaper-native UI, native wave. Seven kit pages take the menu slots of the stock Wireless and LAN
tabs, with stock's nvram and stock's apply requests:
- Reaper_WPS.asp, Reaper_WDS.asp, Reaper_MACFilter.asp, Reaper_RADIUS.asp (shows which bands use
  the server), Reaper_RoamBlock.asp. The roaming block list is read from all three radios (stock
  read wl0 only and wrote all three, so a list that had diverged lost entries on the next save);
  only changed keys are posted; device names go in as text.
- Reaper_MLO.asp (Wireless > MLO): the master switch, the MLO network list and the backhaul
  editor; "Add a Network" opens the Network page's own MLO wizard (SDN.asp reaperOpenWizard(),
  one-shot flag, cleared before use).
- Reaper_VLAN.asp (LAN > VLAN): Switch and Profiles tabs in place of the two stock tabs; each
  node's ports from get_cfg_clientlist capability 27 (an object keyed by port) and
  /get_port_status.cgi; multi-VID trunks are kept as they are.
- reaper/menu.js tabs, httpd reaper_native[] (+7), RNW_1..RNW_9 in the 25 language packs.
- After the owner reviewed each page on the router the stock pages no longer ship: www/Makefile
  removes Advanced_WWPS / WMode / ACL / WSecurity / Roaming_Block / VLAN_Switch / VLAN_Profile
  and stops copying MLO.asp; httpd reaper_pagemap[] bounces each old URL to its kit page (8
  shipped=0 rows). SDN/mlo.html stays (the Network page's app layout opens it).
Other hunks in these files: www/Makefile also points www/ajax/ouiDB.json at networkmap's
/usr/networkmap/ieee.oui.json where that table exists (one OUI table in the image instead of two,
about 352 KB; a tree whose networkmap ships no table keeps the www copy) and drops the stock WHITE /
ROG / TUF theme files of the AiMesh and Network pages; httpd/reaper_inject.c also lists AiMesh.asp,
SDN.asp, SDN/sdn.html and SDN/mlo.html in reaper_own_theme[] (mode 2, no injected stylesheet), and
SDN.asp links its own stylesheet - both part of the next commit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
