+  o[p + 'timesched'] = '0'; o[p + 'sched'] = ''; o[p + 'expiretime'] = ''; o[p + 'ap_isolate'] = '0'; o[p + 'macmode'] = '0'; o[p + 'mlo'] = '';
+  o[p + 'maclist'] = ''; o[p + 'iot_max_cmpt'] = ''; o[p + '11be'] = '0';
+  o[p + 'dut_list'] = NODES.map(function(n){ return '<' + n.mac + '>0>'; }).join('');   /* stock get_dut_list("0"): no Wi-Fi on any node */
+  nvSet(o); restarting('pf');
+});
+function del(vidx){
+  if (!confirm(`<#VPN_Fusion_Delete_Alert#>`)) return;
+  var v = vlanOf(vidx); if (!v) return;
+  var s = SDN.filter(function(r){ return r.f[0] !== '0' && r.f[3] === vidx; })[0];
+  var o = {action_mode: 'apply', rc_service: 'restart_net_and_phy;'}, gone = function(list, test){
+    var rows = L.parse(list), keep = rows.filter(function(r){ return !test(r); }), out = rows.filter(test);
+    return {list: L.ser(keep), x: L.ser(out)}; };
+  var vr = gone(NV.vlan_rl, function(r){ return r.f[0] === vidx; });
+  var sr = gone(NV.sdn_rl, function(r){ return !!s && r.f[0] === s.f[0]; });
+  var nr = gone(NV.subnet_rl, function(r){ return !!s && s.f[4] !== '0' && r.f[0] === s.f[4]; });
+  var rr = gone(NV.radius_list, function(r){ return !!s && r.f[0] === s.f[0]; });
+  var ar = gone(NV.sdn_access_rl, function(r){ return !!s && (r.f[0] === s.f[0] || r.f[1] === s.f[0]); });
+  o.sdn_rl = sr.list; o.vlan_rl = vr.list; o.subnet_rl = nr.list; o.radius_list = rr.list; o.sdn_access_rl = ar.list;
+  o.sdn_rl_x = sr.x; o.vlan_rl_x = vr.x; o.subnet_rl_x = nr.x; o.radius_list_x = rr.x;
+  if (s) o['apg' + s.f[5] + '_enable'] = '0';
+  if (NV.vlan_trunklist !== '' && +v.f[1] > 1)
+    o.vlan_trunklist = vr.list === '' ? '' : trunkMap(NV.vlan_trunklist, function(a){ return a.filter(function(x){ return x !== v.f[1]; }); });
+  if (NV.qos_enable === '1') o.rc_service += 'restart_qos;restart_firewall;';
+  nvSet(o); restarting('pf');
+}
+
+/* ---------------- load ---------------- */
+function loadPorts(cb){
+  appGet(['get_cfg_clientlist()'], function(d){
+    var src = d && d.get_cfg_clientlist ? d.get_cfg_clientlist : d, arr = [], k;
+    if (Object.prototype.toString.call(src) === '[object Array]') arr = src;
+    else if (src) for (k in src) if (Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(src, k) && src[k] && typeof src[k] === 'object') arr.push(src[k]);
+    NODES = arr.filter(function(n){ return n && n.mac; });
+    /* stock: a node shows when it reports LAN ports (capability 27) and is not a smart-home master (capability 4 bit 22).
+       lan_port is a JSON object keyed by port (rc.c check_lan_port_cap walks it with json_object_object_foreach), not an array */
+    var want = NODES.filter(function(n){
+      var c = n.capability || {}, lp = (c['27'] || {}).lan_port;
+      return lp && typeof lp === 'object' && Object.keys(lp).length > 0 && !((parseInt(c['4'], 10) || 0) & 4194304);
+    });
+    var left = want.length, got = {};
+    if (!left){ cb(); return; }
+    want.forEach(function(n){
+      getJSON('/get_port_status.cgi?node_mac=' + n.mac + '&_=' + Date.now(), function(r){
+        if (r && r.node_info && r.port_info && r.port_info[n.mac]) got[n.mac] = r.port_info[n.mac];
+        if (--left) return;
+        want.forEach(function(w){
+          var pi = got[w.mac]; if (!pi) return;
+          var ports = Object.keys(pi).filter(function(key){ return /^[WL]\d+$/.test(key); }).map(function(key){ return {label: key, d: pi[key]}; });
+          ports.sort(function(a, b){ var ca = a.label.charAt(0), cb2 = b.label.charAt(0); if (ca !== cb2) return ca === 'L' ? -1 : 1; return (+a.label.substring(1)) - (+b.label.substring(1)); });
+          PORTNODES.push({mac: w.mac, model: w.model_name || w.ui_model_name || '', alias: w.alias || '', node: w, ports: ports});
+        });
+        PORTNODES.forEach(function(nd, i){ nd.ports.forEach(function(p){ p.lock = lockOf(nd, p, i === 0); }); });
+        cb();
+      });
+    });
+  });
+}
+function loadApg(cb){
+  var keys = [];
+  SDN.forEach(function(r){ if (r.f[0] !== '0' && vlanOf(r.f[3]) && +r.f[5] > 0) ['ssid', 'dut_list'].forEach(function(f){ keys.push('apg' + r.f[5] + '_' + f); }); });
+  if (!keys.length){ cb(); return; }
+  appGet(keys.map(function(k){ return 'nvram_char_to_ascii(' + k + ',' + k + ')'; }), function(d){
+    if (!d){ msg('topmsg', `<#ALERT_OF_ERROR_System4#>`); cb(); return; }
+    SDN.forEach(function(r){ var a = r.f[5]; if (d['apg' + a + '_ssid'] !== undefined) APG[a] = {ssid: U(d['apg' + a + '_ssid'] || ''), dut: U(d['apg' + a + '_dut_list'] || '')}; });
+    cb();
+  });
+}
+
+q('swdesc').textContent = rp.fmt(`<#VALN_Switch_desc2#>`, `<#All#>` + ' (' + `<#Setting_factorydefault_value#>` + ')', 'Access', 'Trunk');
+q('pfdesc').textContent = `<#VALN_Profile_desc#>`.replace('$feature$', SDN_PAGE);
+rp.wins().forEach(function(w){ w.addEventListener('click', function(){ rp.tabShow(TABS, w.getAttribute('data-t'), 'rvlan_tab'); }); });
+rp.tabShow(TABS, rp.tabFirst('rvlan_tab', /[?&](tab)=(sw|pf)\b/, 'sw'), 'rvlan_tab');
+loadApg(function(){ paintProfiles(); loadPorts(function(){ buildDut(); paintSwitch(); }); });
+})();
+</script>
+</body>
+</html>
